<title>UK: United makes agreed bid for Blenheim.</title>
<headline>United makes agreed bid for Blenheim.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>United News &amp; Media Plc said on Tuesday it has made an agreed offer for Blenheim Group Plc of 5.00 pound a share, valuing the company at 592.5 million pounds.</p>
<p>United said it has already secured acceptances for 51 percent of the exhibitions group.</p>
</text>
